{"id":"helada","lemma":"helada","pos":"noun","rank":4441,"glosses":["frost, freezing","handcuffs"],"ipa":"/eˈlada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"heladas"},"order":4442,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-helada.wav","examples":[{"text":"El agua estaba helada.","en":"The water was cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501274","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Me muero por una bebida helada.","en":"I'm dying for a cold drink.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"drink, beverage"},null]},{"text":"Él se tiró agua helada.","en":"He poured cold water over himself.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to drop intentionally","l":"tirar"},{"g":"water"},null]}]}